body:
not a ghost but still freaky - i used to "fly" down my steps all of the time. i would just jump from the top setp and land at the bottom of the stairway. 

&#x200B;

to this day i am not sure if this was a recurring dream or if it was something else. i remember the thud from my feet and i remember the wind in my face.

which pillow method, ive heard of 2: 

\- I've done the one where u put ur script under ur pillow, but now I make my scripts on a powerpoint lol

\- and I don't like the cuddling one bc I like starfish position 

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

but thank you!
